## 5. Which business model should you choose?

My recommendation
Start an AI Automation and DevOps Automation Agency.
Target small and medium-sized businesses that cannot afford a dedicated automation engineer.

Your services could include:

- n8n installation and self-hosting.
- Workflow development.
- AI agent integration.
- WhatsApp and CRM integration.
- Azure/AWS server automation.
- Ongoing monitoring and maintenance.

## 6. A practical 30-day roadmap

| Period     | What to accomplish                                    |
| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| Days 1–5   | Learn n8n nodes, triggers and workflows               |
| Days 6–10  | Learn REST APIs, webhooks and JSON                    |
| Days 11–15 | Build WhatsApp and CRM automation                     |
| Days 16–20 | Build AI agents and document processing               |
| Days 21–25 | Deploy n8n using Docker on Ubuntu                     |
| Days 26–30 | Create portfolio, approach clients and apply for jobs |

Build these three portfolio projects:

1. AI-powered WhatsApp enquiry management.
2. Automated invoice processing and reporting.
3. Server monitoring with automated email alerts.

